Types come from the closed vocabulary in _references/artifact_types.md.

| File | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `results/pca_pc1_pc2.png` | `figure` | PC1 vs PC2 scatter, points coloured by condition and labelled by sample_id |
| `results/pca_pc1_pc2.pdf` | `figure` | the same plot, vector format |
| `results/pca_scores.tsv` | `table` | one row per sample: `sample_id`, `condition`, `group`, `replicate`, `PC1`…`PC6` |
| `results/pca_variance_explained.tsv` | `table` | one row per component: `component`, `variance_explained_pct`, `cumulative_pct`; header comment records the number of genes used |

## Execution
Runs: batch
One job through the workspace's configured executor (`_system/executorlib.py submit`), in
`gars-bio`. 6 samples x ~200 genes: expected wall time under 2 minutes, memory under 2 GB,
total output under 1 MB.
